#: scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aeddbfd45e6a9854635129a3a6ff119e44b72126c880f77bd46cdc2f9e62350e
#. default-sha256: 3d1793ed94b5723400536b1db6f960dde58f83002e1c89a8bf5b09667af2fcc7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Despite his near devastation by Nellie’s news, "
"Mell’s flaxen eyes continued to wander in hopes of catching sight of the girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫尽管被妹妹的一席话所打击，⟪k:10⟫梅尔也依旧用那双"
"亚麻色的眼睛四处巡视，⟪k:11⟫寻找着白发少女的身影。"

#: scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29110594b616382da2ab9637d96f21d13b358a20bb9a22adf5578d308d4ffd68
#. default-sha256: 9839b5739b2191a4961a0142d02461a158fbe458f257553e64b249dc7250f326
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe. By now, it should be quite obvious to you what Mell was feeling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫呵呵，⟪k:1⟫现在的他，心里究竟怀着何种感情，⟪k:2⟫想必老爷您也明白了吧？"

#: scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8bf0c3081b3e4c685bef097a7c9b4803f470c8ff1d82da0fff385910dd5a80d
#. default-sha256: 48aec24a6fd8ddfbc32ef6b9171f87e85f71090159e74776a18129628c90544b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the boy himself was having difficulty comprehending the things going through his heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫可惜他并不了解自己这份情愫。"

#: scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b156bae986cff6362afc770ccc3800f00789e2268e21c46c22b36739d04838e3
#. default-sha256: 245318c64ffe85d39870c5a6976798df64385a8297e77b8dcd933f30ee44acce
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Emotionally, he was horribly unstable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like a ship without a sail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就好像迷失在汪洋大海中的小舟一般，⟪k:1⟫他的心头写满了迷茫。"

#: scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5feb73a4a98d043bc4c8a0d87db065ce7e21445cabcd86ab813f09537bb18c03
#. default-sha256: 0eee413cc739b08a5130b46ecca8d6f0610dc7582b1a17eed021da75b8abe7c7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And still, every time he spotted the White-Haired Girl, his heart would leap, his whole body "
"jitter with anxiety and excitement."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫仅仅是对少女的匆匆一瞥，⟪k:1⟫就让他心跳加速、呼吸困难。⟪k:2⟫继而，喜悦和不安两种情绪混杂在心"
"头，⟪k:3⟫久久无法散去。"

#: scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2636da960a297b8d85278cdc4ba85b1cf0699f16703b316698ad5f4b4b2e0c21
#. default-sha256: 607082a48a33e68c398649435deaec5d04db74fadb1aea6db3ae288d6a599b3e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had never felt anything like this before, and as such, he struggled to keep these strange "
"emotions in check."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫未经情事的梅尔，⟪k:1⟫第一次如此深陷其中。⟪k:2⟫正因如此，⟪k:3⟫他更不知如何驾驭这份感情。"

#: scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83037d6424f525b1f9ac250a508b815f9455d13f8c52a36536046068a84bbb2f
#. default-sha256: 78ec302e964ef20024edf04894d38ade147122e8cebf24f3f2936e9bbb7571c3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whenever he saw an opportunity, Mell would speak to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫梅尔只要一有机会就会上前向白发少女搭话。"

#: scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 299d68cf7dbf5ba0819366cb36fd0e45f378620e537ada3d2b9fcc3f5f000559
#. default-sha256: 77e2062ec727435a3e2c8f23722158a4b37b5a19e01e4414dee0ffa30941fba3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And days he was unable to, he either spent in secluded silence or a distracted daze."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而没能说上话的日子里，⟪k:1⟫他会一整天都闷闷不乐，⟪k:2⟫或是心不在焉地望着天空发呆吧。"

#: scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29cd6be997d32c746cffb83fdae30a5998c8fa2acb8ea81e5947b942c808b40e
#. default-sha256: af624559ff37b4e394d1df31779316f3b0e5bd18d116e1bbab48efd465a7dacf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Love is a curious thing.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It has the power to change those who experience it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫爱情真是不可思议……⟪k:1⟫它的力量是如此之大，⟪k:2⟫能轻而易举地改变一个人。"

#: scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2774037ecaa80d6a288a649bbdb49745cc545b0013bd74c5a0e482d18da91fe8
#. default-sha256: ce0ce94ed9e2f39cb6407e383ccebcac1746900f2d3931a08f232b7d4e5c0410
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When he did manage to approach her, he tripped over his tongue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Again and again he "
"talked to her, and again and again he stumbled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他的谈吐依旧笨拙。⟪k:1⟫在少女面前，⟪k:2⟫他的话题很快会冷场，⟪k:3⟫冷场后他又急忙寻找着别的话"
"题……如此循环重复着这个过程。"

#: scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 736242e41c6bd4d6396cb23668c59626058d3950d799c40b60f914fd30cda632
#. default-sha256: 4f6cfc4f33d9d7971d05170d574d5b9c4f5790d1e88db9877da77e861e836e9b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine, if you were to take him to see a romance at the theatre in his present state, he "
"would cry just as much as little Nellie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫换作现在的他，⟪k:1⟫再一次观看有关恋爱的话剧的话，⟪k:2⟫没准会感同身受地跟着一起流泪呢。"

#: scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2f6038125d65fd2c2aa0315a2be6326ca2ed587c2f28d21af0ce794b15905b5
#. default-sha256: b532beebd0ffc337974e05969d25f406044851c73b3a9ec398dd93cd88078fe3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We cry at tragedies because we draw parallels with our own lives.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At least, that is "
"what I think."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「悲剧之所以叫做悲剧，是因为观众从中找到了自己的身影」。⟪k:1⟫至少下仆是这么认为的。"

#: scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be2228d50a1abc23bdb61126c6af8cbf6a14568da7099fdbc0b72ec8c5a7e41f
#. default-sha256: d29d829492a2e2f5f81fa1b84ab780e25e80b8e84369436b57a740df2b32aadf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Great tales of romance attain true gravity with the audience only when they are personally "
"familiar with love."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只有切身体会过爱情的人，⟪k:1⟫才能真正读懂那些爱情故事的真谛吧。"

#: scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f651c4e0d55a02d6fd2cf377a141524d17c25623e9648163b04f7cd748413434
#. default-sha256: 1825b3657dd3ba20c0aaccdfb0acd655c7a68e70ac688496b8b81f1a5aed744f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In any event, the White-Haired Girl was, as a result of this, visibly perturbed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……至于白发少女本人嘛，⟪k:1⟫面对梅尔的攻势流露出了为难的神色。"

#: scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13adfa1a819b623e877c19d255776aa715d0e7b86043a392e1b01a348a9c1c64
#. default-sha256: 624ac909ce07507ac3f912d5ce3313884c38bbc9c5ed8162c27808bbb4fba26e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was delighted that he was being so kind to her, but confusion overpowered every other "
"emotion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫从少女的角度来说，⟪k:1⟫能被梅尔温柔地搭话其实感觉不坏。⟪k:2⟫但除了喜悦，⟪k:3⟫她也同样感到了自"
"身的动摇。"

#: scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0743cc277487f27f1f83c1450a99154153b24f62a8b3a412b720b82107f6d52
#. default-sha256: 07f51d88e556108b0b6e406b40cd9a75fb965933eb0cb460fc63204bac229242
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be at a loss for what to do as he clumsily catapulted words and stares at "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但凡注视着那双亚麻色的眼睛，⟪k:1⟫亦或听见他温柔的声音，⟪k:2⟫都会让她手足无措，⟪k:3⟫不知该如何"
"回应。"

#: scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 615e99fdb03bf349e3120cc0dffee6b991aa39c291695762c4650b4156fc671e
#. default-sha256: 8d2d45d5d86a62abd9badd9e04fe4a954ee27c2c510c072d38953d6742833b01
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Mell did not back down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though he probably knew not what ⟪k:3⟫caused⟪k:4⟫ such "
"fiery emotion to erupt from within his breast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫纵使少女一脸茫然，⟪k:1⟫梅尔却不知退却。⟪k:2⟫他心中的强烈情感如火山喷发，⟪k:3⟫根本无法自持。"

#: scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fe7a668a6b2123745536a3a8f81902ab2f0b4bf4239c607fb0dd84c1adc825c
#. default-sha256: 930cde0917e77251c0af218f4f6da6873f8c54a8cedcff4feb7dc71b8be8c2a8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One’s first love, in particular, tends to burn like a wildfire.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you familiar "
"with the sensation, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「初恋如同干柴遇烈火」。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫老爷您也能明白这句话的意思，⟪k:3⟫对吗？"

#: scenario:scenario_D35FE190_0FD7_4935_AF30_325B9163FF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa38f8746b71128fa96f1ddff1933ffcb445ab844a75e7ab973716622089ed59
#. default-sha256: 8d8de586e3d81740dfb77b02f92da6f023ba0e859e11d026023417db20f2247a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D35FE190_0FD7_4935_AF30_325B9163FF7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh? ⟪k:1⟫Hehehe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……呵呵。"

#: scenario:scenario_A10B5545_1CA3_48D3_92E1_291FDC46E57E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b6066a68d3cbcc1bbc865bc4cbece5329d018a69346d3126da0d0b5faef679d
#. default-sha256: 4579ca6f27a9db9dc2a7923fe7fcd3f3956ba0b18bd5e3775df5f535f223ca9c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A10B5545_1CA3_48D3_92E1_291FDC46E57E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫啊……"

#: scenario:scenario_0064EE85_B55F_4F23_BFFE_56AA12E5CDD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c39decb8b540780c323831089d94553fd54246e2d2ebbd58b94c81dd9391dc70
#. default-sha256: ff8b00f91c9e3bf95b9b55bbc4d276ca75aa32108a970fd62f4924e4e844cbea
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0064EE85_B55F_4F23_BFFE_56AA12E5CDD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(There she is. ⟪k:2⟫Is she cleaning?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫No, it looks like she’s reading.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（是她……⟪k:2⟫在打扫吗……不太像。⟪k:3⟫是在看书？）"

#: scenario:scenario_A3BEDA6B_AC81_44AA_8E43_67485521CCCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76fffe7993c8018901a7abab1a27717d4933cb722f244be3e306d47e9ebdb685
#. default-sha256: d6920d912b0383326511c3535c8613fd3fbf1fe226d020f7938c1d7fb4456ec4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3BEDA6B_AC81_44AA_8E43_67485521CCCC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(It’s now or never.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫（好，⟪k:3⟫这次一定要……）"

#: scenario:scenario_FCDD3A5A_AE3F_4E8A_9DBD_6B37D25F6AB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a6edde8356f593eca68cde96f808bbeda31fdba7aea69442a0563ce921b7312
